#. type: Title =
#: .translation-src/dengjen-tts/docs/modules/ROOT/pages/index.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "dengjen-tts"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: .translation-src/dengjen-tts/docs/modules/ROOT/pages/index.adoc:4
msgid "A cross-platform Rust engine for neural TTS models."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: .translation-src/dengjen-tts/docs/modules/ROOT/pages/index.adoc:5
#: .translation-src/dengjen-piper-rs/docs/modules/ROOT/pages/index.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Features"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: .translation-src/dengjen-tts/docs/modules/ROOT/pages/index.adoc:8
msgid ""
"*Models*: https://github.com/rhasspy/piper[Piper], "
"https://github.com/hexgrad/kokoro[Kokoro], and "
"https://github.com/myshell-ai/MeloTTS[MeloTTS] ONNX voices, including Kokoro "
"per-voice style embeddings"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: .translation-src/dengjen-tts/docs/modules/ROOT/pages/index.adoc:9
msgid ""
"*Phonemization*: eSpeak-ng (100+ languages, IPA output) and Arabic "
"diacritization via `libtashkeel`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: .translation-src/dengjen-tts/docs/modules/ROOT/pages/index.adoc:10
msgid "*Multi-speaker voices*: select by `speaker_id`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: .translation-src/dengjen-tts/docs/modules/ROOT/pages/index.adoc:11
msgid ""
"*Streaming synthesis*: chunked output (`chunk_size`/`chunk_padding`) and a "
"realtime gRPC stream"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: .translation-src/dengjen-tts/docs/modules/ROOT/pages/index.adoc:12
msgid "*Prosody control*: rate, pitch, and volume via `sonic-sys` (libsonic)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: .translation-src/dengjen-tts/docs/modules/ROOT/pages/index.adoc:13
msgid "*Synthesis modes*: lazy, parallel, and batched, selectable per request"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: .translation-src/dengjen-tts/docs/modules/ROOT/pages/index.adoc:14
msgid ""
"*Bindings*: native Rust, C-API (`libdengjen`), Python (`pyo3`), gRPC (any "
"language over the wire), and a CLI"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: .translation-src/dengjen-tts/docs/modules/ROOT/pages/index.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Not yet supported, tracked on the issue tracker: native Go/Java/Kotlin "
"bindings and a Matcha-TTS model loader. RHVoice-style formant/statistical "
"synthesis is a different synthesis paradigm from this engine's neural-ONNX "
"pipeline and isn't planned."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: .translation-src/dengjen-tts/docs/modules/ROOT/pages/index.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Crates"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: .translation-src/dengjen-tts/docs/modules/ROOT/pages/index.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"|Crate |Purpose\n"
"\n"
"|`espeak-phonemizer`\n"
"|Converts text to IPA phonemes using a patched version of eSpeak-ng\n"
"\n"
"|`dengjen-model`\n"
"|Handles model loading and inference using `onnxruntime` via `ort`\n"
"\n"
"|`dengjen-tts`\n"
"|Wraps `DengjenModel` and adds synthesized speech post-processing, including "
"changing prosody. Also provides different modes of parallelism.\n"
"\n"
"|`dengjen-tts-grpc`\n"
"|https://grpc.io/[GRPC] frontend for dengjen\n"
"\n"
"|`libdengjen`\n"
"|C-API binding to dengjen\n"
"\n"
"|`dengjen-tts-python`\n"
"|Python bindings to `dengjen-tts` using `pyo3`\n"
"\n"
"|`sonic-sys`\n"
"|Rust FFI bindings to https://github.com/waywardgeek/sonic[Sonic]: a C "
"library for controlling rate, volume, and pitch of generated speech\n"
msgstr ""

