#. type: Title ==
#: .translation-src/pact-avro-plugin/docs/modules/ROOT/pages/testing.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "Provider"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: .translation-src/pact-avro-plugin/docs/modules/ROOT/pages/testing.adoc:49
msgid ""
"The message provider is verified by getting it to generate a message, and "
"then this is verified against the Pact file from the consumer. There are two "
"main ways of verifying the provider:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: .translation-src/pact-avro-plugin/docs/modules/ROOT/pages/testing.adoc:51
msgid ""
"Write a test in the provider code base that can call the provider to "
"generate the message."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: .translation-src/pact-avro-plugin/docs/modules/ROOT/pages/testing.adoc:52
msgid ""
"Use an HTTP proxy server that can call the provider and return the generated "
"message, and then use a Pact framework verifier to verify it."
msgstr ""

